able - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 125.6 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen typing in the script editor, the script editor will lose focus and focus the shader editor. Your input will then go inside the shader editor window instead of the script editor. This happens often.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a scene.\n2. Add a Sprite2D\n3. Add a texture to that sprite.\n4. Add a material - create a new shadermaterial.\n5. Create a new shader.\n6. Close shader editor.\n7. Add a script to the Sprite2D.\n8. Begin typing in the script editor.\n9. After some input, the focus will be moved to shader editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[462-shader-editor-focus-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27407342/462-shader-editor-focus-bug.zip)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e29e20f6-e5e5-4332-b10f-927741441944","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","